WEBVTT

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.540
Go...

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.170
I'll be going then!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.170
Sure thing!

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.420
Go, SoLaMi Dressing! Go-rgonzola!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.140
No regrets!

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:34.720
Do your best!

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:35.430
Yeah!

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.100
Do your best, Lala!

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.050
