00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.180
Complete-pri!

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.300
Complete.

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:41.430
Go!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.060
Complete!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.020
