00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.460
What? Uh, yes?

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.240
We're all Falulu fans.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.430
Today's the day.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:02.370
At first we were all about how perfect she was.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:07.950
But now we've realized that even though she's not always perfect, we still want to support her.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:14.250
She really just wanted to be a normal girl, right?

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:17.210
SoLaMi SMILE... Dressing Pafé...

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:18.010
Yes?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:21.970
Please, you have to revive her with the show today!

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.160
Please!

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:30.290
Capisce!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.650
Well we've heard your voices!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.470
Pri!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:37.170
Our fate is in the hands of the gods.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.990
You can count on me!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.400
Thank you very much!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.700
Best of luck!

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.660
Good, Unicorn's not around.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.320
Falulu...

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:55.080
<i>Bye bye, rubbish idol Lala with the Prism Voice!</i>

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.550
<i>Capisce! Pri! Pshu!</i>

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.800
