00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.200
Falulu... We'll wake you up.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.470
We finally really became friends.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.660
Right, Falulu?

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:35.120
No need to run.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:40.670
Had I known it would end up like this, I would have just let her do whatever she pleased.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:44.710
What she wanted to do...

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.640
I wish I'd just allowed her to be free.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:52.730
She wanted to learn more. She wanted to see more.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:57.650
She wanted to go out and touch the world she was born into.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:02.140
Well, she would... Of course she would.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:08.240
So, uh, Unicorn, just so you know, I'll work super hard!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.290
We'll draw out the power of the Paradise Coord and make a miracle happen!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:16.310
We'll make Falulu Come Back Live work for sure!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:17.630
Make sure to come see it!

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.930
Falulu Come Back Live...

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.210
It's a good title.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.810
Excuse us.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.680
We have letters of encouragement from all over the country.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.290
And flowers-kuma!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.590
And presents-usa!

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:38.080
This is just a small fraction of it-kuma.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:38.900
Usa!

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.170
And we're looking forward to the show as well.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.610
And it's about time.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.680
Can you see it, Falulu?

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.140
Please wake up, Falulu.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.950
Cosmo!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:25.300
I've got the hair accessories for your Paradise Coords all figured out.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:26.740
Cosmic looking forward to it.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:29.570
Thank you, Sister.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.950
I can't wait to see!

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:35.370
I'm counting on you.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.800
Yeah!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.050
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.330
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.470
