00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.710
I'll be praying for the legendary Paradise Coord to glow tonight.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:02.230
Lala's hair is adorned with the gloriously glittering Paradise Tiara.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.580
Paradise Coord!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:10.310
