00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.290
Paradise Coord!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:29.190
Go!

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:35.860
And Dorothy has this captivating star jewel accessory.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.520
Yay!

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.290
And Leona isn't far behind with that.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.920
The pearls accenting the tips of the star are wonderful.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:48.400
Good luck with Falulu Come Back Live!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.610
