00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:09.400
What is it?

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:11.220
What should I do?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.790
My legs got all wobbly all of a sudden.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:18.760
