00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.510
Yeah... If we can't make it glow...

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:24.650
If we can't make that miracle happen, what then?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:27.750
Chop!

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.620
Slap!

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.470
Tension relax.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:37.200
Tell me what you're all here for-pri!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:43.330
Falulu!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.250
Let's get what where here for to the max!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.750
Yeah!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.710
<i>Please, come back relax.</i>

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.940
<i>We're bringing you back no matter what.</i>

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:55.890
Victory.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:56.830
Cool!

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.350
Chanko!
Cool!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.560
Yay!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.060
