00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.730
Good luck, Lala!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.720
<i>Concentrate!</i>

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.950
<i>Fight!</i>

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.670
<i>Let's do our best!</i>

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.340
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.800
Making Drama Switch On!

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:15.120
