00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.600
<i>We are not beaten! Our spirit is not broken!</i>

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.450
I knew it...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.840
It... It's gone? The light's...

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.100
No way-kuma!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.050
Just as we feared-usa...

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:07.950
I'm sorry, Falulu! I'm sorry, everyone!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.580
I, I...

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.380
