00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:30.530
Does this mean <i>anyone's</i> voice can reach a listener's soul if they truly wish for it?

00:15:41.370 --> 00:16:11.240
Falulu!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.540
Yeah!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.210
Yes.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.870
Falulu!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.970
Lady Falulu!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.140
Falulu!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.350
Pri!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.310
