00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.940
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:38.540
Speeding into the future! We Are PriPara!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.670
PriTickets!

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:09.100
