00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.580
Falulu!

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.860
Everyone! Thank you! wordswordswordswords

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.840
Falulu!

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.180
