00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:33.590
Me too!

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:11.570
Falulu gets to sing more? To hang out with everyone again?

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:13.230
Thank you, everyone!

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:14.080
Thank you!

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:18.270
Isn't it great, Falulu? We need to celebrate this!

00:23:18.270 --> 00:23:19.330
Celebrate?

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.790
A birthday party for your rebirth!

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:24.460
Birthday party? I've never had one!

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.420
